H('260.d.9.C',4,"A forecast based on a very small sample is:","Less accurate",["More accurate","Perfect","Unchanging"],"Small samples vary.")
H('260.d.10.A',3,"Setting a low price to attract many buyers quickly is called:","Penetration pricing",["Skimming","Prestige pricing","Bundle only"],"Low entry price.")
