H('262.d.6.E',3,"Sources of data a business can analyze include sales records, website traffic, and:","Customer surveys",["Fortune cookies","Tides","Moon phases"],"Real data sources.")
H('262.d.6.E',4,"Loyalty card purchase histories are a source of:","Customer buying behavior data",["Weather data","Tax data","Property data"],"They show purchases.")
