H('262.d.10.D',3,"Marketing ethics requires that promotional messages be:","Truthful and not misleading",["Exaggerated","Hidden","Confusing"],"Honest ads.")
H('262.d.10.D',4,"Advertising a sale price that was never actually offered is:","Deceptive and unethical",["Smart","Legal","Standard practice"],"Deception is unethical.")
